{"topicSections":[{"title":"Type Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/SupportedVersions\/isSwiftSixLanguageMode","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/SupportedVersions\/minimumSwiftToolsVersion","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/SupportedVersions\/newestTestedSwift"]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/SupportedVersions"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SupportedVersions","kind":"identifier"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The floor enforces itself: SwiftPM reads "},{"code":"swift-tools-version","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" before it resolves"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"anything, and an older toolchain refuses the package outright with a clear message."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Nothing enforces the upper end — a package declaring tools-version 5.9 resolves and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"builds on a Swift 6 toolchain whether or not anybody ever compiled it there, and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"differences that matter (strict concurrency, "},{"code":"Sendable","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" inference, isolation checking)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are exactly the ones that surface as errors only once someone tries."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"These values name both ends, so a build script or a compatibility note can report the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"range without hardcoding numbers that go stale."}]},{"anchor":"Two-manifests","type":"heading","text":"Two manifests","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The package ships "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Package.swift"},{"type":"text","text":" (tools-version 5.9) "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"and"}]},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Package@swift-6.0.swift"},{"type":"text","text":" (tools-version 6.0). SwiftPM selects by toolchain, which is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"what lets the SDK keep a 5.9 floor while compiling its own targets in "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Swift 6"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"language mode"}]},{"type":"text","text":" wherever a 6.x toolchain is present — full strict-concurrency checking"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as errors, without dropping consumers still on 5.9."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"VersionPolicyTests"},{"type":"text","text":" asserts these values against both manifests and the CI matrix, so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"none of them can drift."}]}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/supportedversions"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK"]]},"metadata":{"symbolKind":"enum","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SupportedVersions","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"SupportedVersions","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"SupportedVersions","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Enumeration","externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK17SupportedVersionsO","modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The range of Swift versions this SDK is built and tested against."}],"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The official Swift SDK for AXI