portedVersions","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"SupportedVersions"}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/supportedversions"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/SupportedVersions/isSwiftSixLanguageMode":{"abstract":[{"text":"Whether ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"this library","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" was compiled in Swift 6 language mode.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/SupportedVersions\/isSwiftSixLanguageMode","title":"isSwiftSixLanguageMode","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"isSwiftSixLanguageMode"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/supportedversions\/isswiftsixlanguagemode"}}}